  "scope": "Complete unchanged Card, three M3 default classes and variant enum execute on finite CardTheme/ThemeData/ColorScheme/Color/shape/insets/Material/semantics/context parents, M3 branch only.30 selected precedence/default/semantics/shape/identity recipes per environment. M2 is explicitly excluded. Full original Material/shape/typography/renderer/engine and native/physical semantics/reader remain separate. Shared selected margin/shape/transparent defaults and explicit caller/theme Color references are compared. Default ColorScheme role reference ABI uses the existing own ARGB adapter and is excluded from source color identity comparison. Product is M3 only; source useMaterial3/M2 branch is excluded. Existing CardTheme/Material/shape/ink/semantics owners remain; no duplicate renderer or compatibility aliases. Typed TS named-factory options keep inherited/prototype getters and original receivers, read each field once and retain source defaults/explicit zero/false/null policy. This adapter adds no numeric claims."
